    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the dimensionality reduction attack of advanced civilizations, the earth has become a two-dimensional world composed of words. As the last sword holder, you will use the power of words to fight against the obstruction of advanced civilizations, gradually restore the world's colors and weather, and finally rebuild the three-dimensional space. In this war between words and dimensions, each Chinese character may become the key to changing your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to start this unprecedented text adventure?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text interaction: push, delete, and modify words to change the environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimension reconstruction: gradually restore the three-dimensional world from black and white text</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle challenge: crack the text trap set by advanced civilizations</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featured highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative &quot;text physics&quot; system, Chinese characters are both scenes and tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive world evolution, witness the wonderful transformation from two-dimensional to three-dimensional</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrate the science fiction elements of &quot;The Three-Body Problem&quot; to experience a unique dimensionality reduction war</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High degree of freedom puzzle solving, bringing players a multi-ending interactive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Independent development by individuals, bringing a refreshing text interactive experience</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >University campus, shopping streets, primeval forests, etc.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the dimensionality reduction attack of advanced civilizations, the earth has become a two-dimensional world composed of words. As the last sword holder, you will use the power of words to fight against the obstruction of advanced civilizations, gradually restore the world's colors and weather, and finally rebuild the three-dimensional space. In this war between words and dimensions, each Chinese character may become the key to changing your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to start this unprecedented text adventure?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text interaction: push, delete, and modify words to change the environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimension reconstruction: gradually restore the three-dimensional world from black and white text</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle challenge: crack the text trap set by advanced civilizations</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featured highlights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative &quot;text physics&quot; system, Chinese characters are both scenes and tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive world evolution, witness the wonderful transformation from two-dimensional to three-dimensional</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrate the science fiction elements of &quot;The Three-Body Problem&quot; to experience a unique dimensionality reduction war</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High degree of freedom puzzle solving, bringing players a multi-ending interactive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Independent development by individuals, bringing a refreshing text interactive experience</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >University campus, shopping streets, primeval forests, etc.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a text puzzle exploration game created by an individual developer. you will be the last &quot;sword bearer&quot; and gradually restore the color and dimension of the world by pushing, deleting and modifying text. Of course, you will also face the dimensionality reduction attack of higher civilizations",
